@guide A_Human_Elwynn
@name Northshire & Elwynn Forest
@faction Alliance
@races Human
@levels 1-10
@zone Elwynn Forest
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Human starting route. Northshire Valley to level 5, then Goldshire, the Stonefield and Maclure farms, Eastvale and Westbrook. Ends at about level 10, ready for Westfall.
@next A_Westfall

